<template><div class="app-container"><el-alert title="主连基差为现货与主连期货的价差数据，数据来源及口径因品种而异，仅供研究观察。" type="info" :closable="false" show-icon /><el-form inline class="query"><el-form-item label="主连合约"><el-select v-model="thscode" filterable style="width:280px" @change="load"><el-option v-for="item in contracts" :key="item.thscode" :value="item.thscode" :label="`${item.thscode}｜${item.contract_name||item.variety_name||''}`" /></el-select></el-form-item></el-form><el-table v-loading="loading" :data="rows" border height="620"><el-table-column prop="trade_date" label="交易日" /><el-table-column prop="spot_price" label="现货价" /><el-table-column prop="close_price" label="主连收盘" /><el-table-column prop="close_basis" label="收盘基差" /><el-table-column prop="close_basis_rate" label="收盘基差率" /><el-table-column prop="settle_basis" label="结算基差" /><el-table-column prop="settle_basis_rate" label="结算基差率" /></el-table></div></template>
<script setup name="FutureHistoryBasis">
import { ref } from 'vue'; import { listFutureBasis } from '@/api/future/history'
const contracts=ref([]),thscode=ref(''),rows=ref([]),loading=ref(false);function load(){if(!thscode.value)return;loading.value=true;listFutureBasis(thscode.value).then(r=>rows.value=r.data||[]).finally(()=>loading.value=false)}listFutureBasis().then(r=>{contracts.value=r.data||[];thscode.value=contracts.value.find(x=>x.thscode==='AZL.DCE')?.thscode||contracts.value[0]?.thscode||'';load()})
</script><style scoped>.query{margin:16px 0}</style>
